From 83d17ea89b3c10946473812c098e06ef45d0e600 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mlgprorektm8 <67933lance@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 13:45:54 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] White flash and menu bar fixes, shader pre-build, race
 compile fixes

- FIX-122/123/124: buffers are not read in place where a picture or a
  shader wrote them lately, nor outside races (GT Sport's car screens:
  car view blown out to white, dashboard panel white or magenta, white
  frame after picking a car). perf ids 144, 145, 146.
- FIX-125: graphics fences wait for the GPU only while buffers are read
  in place (menu frosted-glass bars lost their blur every few frames).
  perf id 147.
- FIX-121: flip image barrier before presenting (perf 143).
- FIX-113/114/115/119: no compile slow motion in races, short waits for
  building pipelines, tessellated and legacy pipelines skip in races.
- PB-1/2/3: shader pre-build (replay translation from stored programs,
  template test, file read scan).
- Diagnostics (env-gated): DIAG-124..133, flight recorder
  (SHADGT_FLASH_WATCH=3/4), direct-read bisect switches.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
